        "id": "LeblancP",
        "name": "Mirror Image",
        "summary": "When LeBlanc drops below 40% Health, she becomes invisible for 1 second and creates a Mirror Image that deals no damage and lasts for up to 8 seconds.",
        "bodyHtml": "When LeBlanc drops below 40% Health, she becomes <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">Invisible</span> for 1 second and creates a harmless clone for 8 seconds. LeBlanc can move the clone with the \"Alt\" key.",
