        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "LeblancQ",
        "name": "Sigil of Malice",
        "summary": "LeBlanc projects a sigil, dealing damage and marking the target for 3.5 seconds. Damaging the marked target with an ability detonates the sigil, dealing additional damage. If either part kills the target, Leblanc refunds the Mana cost and part of this spell's remaining Cooldown.",
        "bodyHtml": "LeBlanc projects a sigil to an enemy, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(65/90/115/140/165 + (40% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and marking them for 3.5 seconds.<br /><br />Damaging the marked enemy with an Ability detonates the sigil, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(65/90/115/140/165 + (40% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.<br /><br />If either part kills the target, Leblanc refunds 100% of the Mana cost and 30% of this spell's remaining Cooldown.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The initial sigil deals an additional 10 damage to minions. </span>",
