        "summary": "LeBlanc launches a chain that shackles the first enemy hit. If the target remains shackled for 1.5 seconds, LeBlanc roots them and deals additional damage.",
        "bodyHtml": "LeBlanc launches a chain that shackles the first enemy hit, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(50/70/90/110/130 + (40% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and granting <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">True Sight</span>.<br /><br />If they remain shackled for 1.5 seconds, LeBlanc <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Roots</span> them for 1.5 seconds and deals an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/120/160/200/240 + (85% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.",
