        "summary": "LeBlanc casts a mimicked version of one of her basic spells.",
        "bodyHtml": "LeBlanc mimics her most recent Ability, using it again. The mimicked Ability deals increased damage.<br /><br /><span>Mimicked Sigil of Malice</span> deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(70/150/230 + (40% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> when applied, and <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(140/300/460 + (80% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> when consumed.<br /><span>Mimicked Distortion</span> deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(150/315/480 + (90% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.<br /><span>Mimicked Ethereal Chains</span> deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(70/150/230 + (40% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> when shackled and <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(140/300/460 + (85% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> when <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Rooting</span>.",
